ce/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":3884860,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3884860-1846651706696412","game_id":"steam-3884860","kind":"announcement","title":"Story Trailer, Pricing, And Discounts!","summary":"Whether you're new to Fabletown or you've been here before, we're trying to do right by you at launch. Here's the breakdown of pricing and launch discounts (off the $24.99 price) for The Wolf Among Us Remastered. Plus, get a peek at Bigby's Big Bad Wolf makeover in the new story trailer!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T18:47:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696412","verified_at":"2026-10-21T02:52:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3884860-1846651706691633","game_id":"steam-3884860","kind":"announcement","title":"Next Fest Demo!","summary":"RIGHT NOW, you can download the free demo for The Wolf Among Us Remastered during Steam Next Fest! (We could not wait for October 29th!) Grab it, play it, and let us know what you think!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:11:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691633","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3884860-1846651706691234","game_id":"steam-3884860","kind":"announcement","title":"The Wolf Among Us Remastered: Next Fest Playthrough","summary":"Watch the Telltale team play the Steam Next Fest demo of The Wolf Among Us Remastered.The developers who brought Fabletown back sit down to play Episode 1, the same demo you can download right now, and talk through the remaster as they go.Play it yourself. The demo is free for the length of Steam Next Fest, through October 26.Wishlist now. The Wolf Among Us Remastered launches October 29, 2026.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:52:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691234","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3884860-1846651706675088","game_id":"steam-3884860","kind":"announcement","title":"The Wolf Among Us Remastered | Remastering A Legend | Out October 29","summary":"See what makes The Wolf Among Us Remastered the definitive edition: Improved lighting, updated animation, refined environments, the all-new Noir Mode, never-before-seen playable deleted scenes, behind-the-scenes video interviews, and more. This remaster is a proper return to Fabletown, for Telltale's acclaimed noir narrative thriller, inspired by DC's award-winning Fables comic series. Fully remastered with enhanced visuals and modern presentation, The Wolf Among Us Remastered brings Bigby Wolf'","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T17:16:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706675088","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3884860-1842212951299997","game_id":"steam-3884860","kind":"announcement","title":"Release Date Announcement and Noir Mode!","summary":"The Wolf Among Us Remastered launches October 29, 2026. Introducing the all-new Noir Mode: Play the entire story in a striking black-and-white presentation inspired by classic noir cinema. Switch it on at any time. Every interrogation, back alley, and hard choice plays out like the detective film Fabletown always deserved. With one tap, jump between Noir Mode and the fully remastered look whenever you want. Step back into Fabletown in the definitive edition of Telltale's acclaimed noir narrative","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T13:06:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951299997","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3884860-1840310314352086","game_id":"steam-3884860","kind":"announcement","title":"Choices Matter Festival Starts Today!","summary":"We're currently live with a special interview segment with Spawn on Me’s Kahlief Adams and The Wolf Among Us Remastered executive producer!The Choices Matter Festival celebrates games of various genres with diverging storylines and critical decisions at the forefront. More than 90 featured titles will be discounted during the event that also includes 40-plus playable demos, behind-the-scenes content, interviews, developer commentary, exclusive announcements, and two world premieres. There's TONS","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-10T17:00:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314352086","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3884860-1835871199305044","game_id":"steam-3884860","kind":"announcement","title":"1st Community Night - Q&A with Wolf Remaster Executive Producer!","summary":"Our FIRST Community Night is tonight, June 18th! For our first night, we'll be joined by the Executive Producer of The Wolf Among Us Remastered! He also worked on the original Wolf Among Us!We'll host the stream on telltale's twitch. He'll be answering questions submitted by the Discord as we talk about his time working on the original game and now the remaster. In addition, we've held a meme competition in the Discord with the two winners winning keys to Wolf Remaster! Join us tonight at 7pmET/","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-18T17:27:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199305044","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3884860-1834602721193879","game_id":"steam-3884860","kind":"announcement","title":"Wolf Among Us Remastered Reveal!","summary":"Welcome Back, Bigby.We’ve seen you asking, and now it’s official. The Wolf Among Us Remastered is coming later this year! The award-winning game is getting a BIG(by) revamp for a new generation. We’re talkin’ enhanced visuals, refined presentation, an updated user interface, improved accessibility features, and technical enhancements including upgraded animation, audio, resolution, and framerate improvements. It’s more than a facelift for modern platforms. We’re giving you behind-the-scenes feat","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-06T14:25:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721193879","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3884860":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:48:06Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:48:05Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3884860":"2026-10-26T00:48:06Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3884860":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:48:05Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:48:05Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5280090":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:48:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:48:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3884860","app_id":3884860,"app_scope":"base"